    "Motor: Stockfish 19 i els seus autors (GPLv3), xarxa nn-1a298aa575a0 (CC0). Puzzles i noms d'obertures: Lichess (CC0). Lletres: Grenze Gotisch i Ysabeau Office (SIL OFL). Peces, tauler, logotip i lliçons: Scachs.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Engine: Stockfish 19 and its authors (GPLv3), network nn-1a298aa575a0 (CC0). Puzzles and opening names: Lichess (CC0). Typefaces: Grenze Gotisch and Ysabeau Office (SIL OFL). Pieces, board, logo and lessons: Scachs."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Motor: Stockfish 19 y sus autores (GPLv3), red nn-1a298aa575a0 (CC0). Puzzles y nombres de aperturas: Lichess (CC0). Tipografías: Grenze Gotisch e Ysabeau Office (SIL OFL). Piezas, tablero, logotipo y lecciones: Scachs."
          }
        }
      }
    },
